WEBVTT

00:00:00.458 --> 00:00:02.210
Previously on Love Live!

00:00:02.210 --> 00:00:06.590
I'd wanted to be a school idol, but I
couldn't make up my mind to do it.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:07.591
There's no way...

00:00:07.591 --> 00:00:09.926
Rin-chan and Maki-chan voiced
their support for me,

00:00:09.926 --> 00:00:11.761
but I couldn't muster up my courage alone...

00:00:11.761 --> 00:00:12.262
Then...

00:00:12.262 --> 00:00:14.139
Even you can do it.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:18.560
I know you've always
dreamed of being an idol.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.688
I truly believe that I want to be
an idol more than anyone else!

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.607
Please accept me as a member of J's!

00:00:23.982 --> 00:00:28.069
Having finally found my source of courage,
I chose to become the idol I've longed to be.

00:00:28.403 --> 00:00:30.113
Alongside Honoka-san and her friends.

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:36.202
Kanda Shrine

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:58.141
Sorry, sorry! Been waiting long?

00:00:58.141 --> 00:01:01.353
Nope. I just got here, too.

00:01:01.353 --> 00:01:04.189
Umi-chan said Archery Club
has practice this morning.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:05.607
Uh-huh.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:08.276
Kotori-chan?

00:01:08.276 --> 00:01:11.821
Honoka-chan! Was a sketchy figure
hiding back there a second ago!?

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:12.572
Back there?

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:14.658
Sneaky time...

00:01:15.533 --> 00:01:16.534
Sneaky, sneaky.

00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:19.120
Sneaky...

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:20.538
Huh?

00:01:28.963 --> 00:01:30.298
Ow!

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:38.973
Honoka-chan?

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:47.023
You.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:50.443
Disband your group immediately!

00:01:54.155 --> 00:01:57.033
Um, so... Who...was that?

00:02:08.712 --> 00:02:13.842
<i>Massugu ha omoi ga minna wo musubu Our honest
feelings are what will fie us all together.</i>

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:18.680
Honki demo bukiyou butsukari au kokoro Even with
our clumsy sincerity, our hearts will still collide.

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:23.476
Sore demo mitaiyo ohkina yume wa And despite
it all, we want to dream a really grand dream.

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:28.064
Koko ni aruyo hajimatta bakari That dream
is here, and it has only now just begun!

00:02:28.064 --> 00:02:29.149
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:33.027
Tanoshii dakejanai tamesarerudarou That it's not
all fun and games— we'll face a lot of obstacles.

00:02:33.027 --> 00:02:34.028
(wakatteru)
(We understand)

00:02:34.028 --> 00:02:37.824
Datte sono kurushisa mo mirai That those
hardships will be paving our futures...

00:02:37.824 --> 00:02:38.908
ikundayo
So here we go!

00:02:38.908 --> 00:02:42.996
Atsumattara tsuyoi jibun ni nattekuyo If we all
join together, we'll be able to become stronger.

00:02:42.996 --> 00:02:47.625
(Kittone) kawari tsuzukete (WE'LL BE A STARY/) (We're sure
that) we will all grow and mature. (We'll become stars!)

00:02:47.625 --> 00:02:52.630
Sorezore ga sukina koto de ganbarerunara That's why we feel
that if we give the things that we love the most our all,

00:02:52.630 --> 00:02:57.302
atarashii (basho ga) gohru dane what awaits
then (our new place) will be our goal.

00:02:57.302 --> 00:03:02.474
Sorezore no sukina koto wo shinjiteireba That's why we
feel that if we believe in the things we love in our lives,

00:03:02.474 --> 00:03:07.437
tokimeki wo (daite) susumerudarou we can learn to
love (then embrace) our butterflies and advance!

00:03:07.437 --> 00:03:12.942
(kowagaru kuse wa sutechae) tobikiri no egao de So crumple up your
fears, throw them away, and then just put on your brightest smiles!

00:03:12.942 --> 00:03:20.533
(tonde tonde takaku) bokura wa ima no naka de (Higher and higher
we"ll fly) The lights that are shining within our hearts...

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:25.288
kagayaki wo matteta
They're waiting to brighten the world.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:29.083
Okay!

00:03:29.417 --> 00:03:36.049
Now that we've got new members, it's time
for our school idol group, y's, to practice!

00:03:36.049 --> 00:03:38.092
How long do you intend
to keep saying that?

00:03:38.092 --> 00:03:40.470
It's been at least two weeks.

00:03:40.470 --> 00:03:43.515
Yeah, but it still makes me so happy!

00:03:43.765 --> 00:03:44.849
#5 - Nico Attacks

00:03:44.849 --> 00:03:46.976
Now then, same as always.

00:03:46.976 --> 00:03:47.727
One!

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:48.353
Two!

00:03:48.353 --> 00:03:48.895
Three!

00:03:48.895 --> 00:03:49.479
Four!

00:03:49.479 --> 00:03:50.104
Five!

00:03:50.104 --> 00:03:50.605
Six!

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:54.400
There's six of us now! Six!

00:03:54.400 --> 00:03:56.569
We're just like a real idol group!

00:03:56.569 --> 00:04:02.408
Maybe someday, us six will be known as
"The Godly Six" or "The Dead Sixies."

00:04:02.408 --> 00:04:04.911
The second one is a little bit morbid, isn't it?

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:09.082
I'm jealous that you can get so pumped
up over the same thing, day after day.

00:04:09.082 --> 00:04:11.835
First, I love being around lots of people.

00:04:11.835 --> 00:04:14.921
Second, with more of us, folks won't
notice my crummy voice as much.

00:04:14.921 --> 00:04:17.382
- Third, even if I miss some dance steps—
- Honoka.

00:04:17.382 --> 00:04:18.800
Kidding, of course...

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:21.386
I agree. We need to do things right.

00:04:21.386 --> 00:04:24.138
Otherwise, people will get mad at
us like that girl did this morning.

00:04:25.306 --> 00:04:26.516
Disband your group!

00:04:26.891 --> 00:04:28.643
She really said that, huh?

00:04:28.643 --> 00:04:31.855
But doesn't that mean we've
become popular enough to hate?

00:04:31.855 --> 00:04:35.817
Whatever it means, we should practice.
We're running out of time.

00:04:35.817 --> 00:04:38.027
Why Maki-chan, aren't you rarin' to go!

00:04:38.027 --> 00:04:42.156
N-No. I just want to get this nonsense
over with so I can go home.

00:04:42.156 --> 00:04:43.449
Again with the attitude.

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:47.745
I saw you at lunch, practicing
your moves in secret.

00:04:47.745 --> 00:04:53.543
0O-Oh, that was because the choreography
yesterday was so bad, I felt I had to fix it.

00:04:53.877 --> 00:04:56.254
It was an embarrassment to dance.

00:04:56.254 --> 00:04:58.006
Oh, I see...

00:04:58.715 --> 00:05:02.260
That was my own original choreography...

00:05:02.260 --> 00:05:03.011
What?

00:05:03.553 --> 00:05:06.055
Don't sweat it!

00:05:06.055 --> 00:05:09.017
Maki-chan's just shy, isn't that right?

00:05:15.857 --> 00:05:17.358
It's raining...

00:05:19.611 --> 00:05:21.404
Raining buckets!

00:05:21.404 --> 00:05:23.656
I did hear that the rainy season just started.

00:05:23.656 --> 00:05:26.326
Yeah, but this downpour is crazy sudden.

00:05:26.326 --> 00:05:29.412
The forecast said there was
only a 60 percent chance!

00:05:29.996 --> 00:05:33.082
Given a 60 percent chance, it would be
more of a surprise if it didn't rain.

00:05:33.082 --> 00:05:37.211
But it's been 60 percent for the last couple
days, and it totally didn't rain either time!

00:05:38.254 --> 00:05:40.256
Looks like it's letting up a bit.

00:05:42.091 --> 00:05:42.967
You're right.

00:05:42.967 --> 00:05:44.886
It was only a 60 percent chance, after all!

00:05:44.886 --> 00:05:46.179
This is great!

00:05:46.179 --> 00:05:48.181
We can practice if it's just this.

00:05:48.181 --> 00:05:51.684
But...the ground is a wet, slippery hazard.

00:05:51.684 --> 00:05:53.436
And who knows if the rain will return.

00:05:55.855 --> 00:05:58.566
It's cool. We can handle this!

00:05:59.776 --> 00:06:01.819
Now I'm excited!

00:06:15.166 --> 00:06:17.710
It's like we're shooting a
music video! Awesome!

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.253
I'm going home.

00:06:19.253 --> 00:06:21.089
M-Maybe ['ll pass on today, too.

00:06:21.089 --> 00:06:24.050
Yeah... There's always tomorrow.

00:06:24.050 --> 00:06:26.010
What? You're all leaving?

00:06:26.010 --> 00:06:28.304
You'll make us look like dorks!

00:06:28.304 --> 00:06:29.263
You are dorks.

00:06:29.973 --> 00:06:35.853
But if the rain persists, we must address
where we can practice properly.

00:06:35.853 --> 00:06:38.106
Can't we practice in the gym?

00:06:38.106 --> 00:06:41.734
Other school clubs make ample
use of the gym and auditorium.

00:06:53.538 --> 00:06:58.292
Those girls aren't showing any
signs of giving up, Nico-cchi.

00:07:09.887 --> 00:07:15.059
Honoka, if you gorge when faced with stress,
you'll be in deep trouble later on.

00:07:15.059 --> 00:07:17.186
Why won't the stupid rain stop?

00:07:17.186 --> 00:07:18.688
How would I know that?

00:07:19.272 --> 00:07:21.232
I was pumped up for practice, too.

00:07:21.232 --> 00:07:24.610
The rain should seriously consider
the mood before doing that.

00:07:30.074 --> 00:07:32.702
Maybe this getup is too conspicuous...

00:07:33.036 --> 00:07:34.120
Poop! Poophead!

00:07:34.120 --> 00:07:34.954
Shut up!

00:07:36.539 --> 00:07:38.249
Honoka-chan...

00:07:38.666 --> 00:07:41.919
I checked the weather forecast again,
and it says to expect rain tomorrow, too.

00:07:41.919 --> 00:07:43.254
What?

00:07:54.474 --> 00:07:55.266
Huh?

00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:01.606
They've vanished.

00:08:01.606 --> 00:08:03.441
Umi-chan, did you spirit them away?

00:08:03.441 --> 00:08:06.235
Forgotten how much you've
eaten already, have you?

00:08:06.235 --> 00:08:07.570
Unbelievable.

00:08:08.154 --> 00:08:09.530
Honoka, did you eat mine?

00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:11.365
I'd never eat food that isn't mine!

00:08:11.657 --> 00:08:13.951
Shouldn't we be discussing
where we can practice?

00:08:13.951 --> 00:08:16.204
Maybe we can borrow an empty classroom.

00:08:16.788 --> 00:08:20.416
We tried asking once before, but the
teacher said we can't have permission...

00:08:20.416 --> 00:08:21.834
because we're not a proper school club.

00:08:22.835 --> 00:08:24.879
Right...

00:08:24.879 --> 00:08:30.218
If only we had five members, we could apply
to form a proper club and use a classroom.

00:08:32.553 --> 00:08:33.554
Five members...?

00:08:34.847 --> 00:08:36.349
But if you only need five...

00:08:41.687 --> 00:08:44.524
That's what was bugging me!
I totally spaced!

00:08:44.524 --> 00:08:46.859
We should apply to be a club!

00:08:46.859 --> 00:08:49.070
You'd seriously forgotten all about that!?

00:08:49.654 --> 00:08:50.696
Huh?

00:08:51.906 --> 00:08:53.199
What'd you say...?

00:08:54.242 --> 00:08:56.953
The stranger's outburst aside,
what do you mean, you spaced?

00:08:57.120 --> 00:09:00.957
Well, I stopped worrying about that stuff
'cuz I was stoked we got more members.

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:04.460
You're hopeless, all of you.

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:07.839
All right! Let's submit our club application
first thing tomorrow morning!

00:09:07.839 --> 00:09:09.841
Then we'll snag a club room.

00:09:10.800 --> 00:09:13.427
I'm so relieved that I think I made
more room in my stomach.

00:09:13.427 --> 00:09:15.096
In other words...

00:09:27.692 --> 00:09:28.693
Hey!

00:09:30.027 --> 00:09:31.904
I told you to disband!

00:09:32.363 --> 00:09:33.406
Disband?

00:09:33.406 --> 00:09:35.992
Screw that! Gimme back my fries!

00:09:35.992 --> 00:09:36.659
The fries!?

00:09:38.327 --> 00:09:39.871
Go buy me some more!

00:09:39.871 --> 00:09:42.206
Both your dancing and singing
fail on every level!

00:09:42.665 --> 00:09:44.333
It's nowhere near professional grade!

00:09:44.333 --> 00:09:45.001
What?

00:09:46.169 --> 00:09:49.630
Listen up! What you're doing is
sacrilege against idol-hood!

00:09:49.630 --> 00:09:50.590
You're an embarrassment!

00:09:51.132 --> 00:09:52.550
You should quit immediately.

00:09:55.887 --> 00:09:57.221
It's Poophead!

00:09:57.221 --> 00:09:59.015
Poophead is running away!

00:09:59.015 --> 00:10:02.101
- Dude, awesome!
- Sure is!

00:10:06.647 --> 00:10:08.149
Idol Study Club?

00:10:08.566 --> 00:10:14.405
Yes. This school has already approved a
club relating to idols—Idol Study Club.

00:10:14.822 --> 00:10:16.657
But it's only got one member, y'know.

00:10:17.033 --> 00:10:20.620
What? You said before that
clubs need five members...

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:23.539
When you're first established, yeah.

00:10:23.539 --> 00:10:26.417
After that, it doesn't really
matter how many you got.

00:10:26.417 --> 00:10:31.172
And with our limited pool of students,
I'd prefer not to bloat our number of clubs.

00:10:31.839 --> 00:10:36.636
Since Idol Study Club already exists,
I cannot accept this club application.

00:10:36.844 --> 00:10:37.970
C'mon...

00:10:37.970 --> 00:10:39.972
There is nothing more for
us to say on the matter.

00:10:39.972 --> 00:10:45.811
So how 'bout you go and chat with
the Idol Study Club's president?

00:10:45.811 --> 00:10:46.854
Nozomi!

00:10:46.854 --> 00:10:50.399
It's not a problem if the two
clubs merge, right?

00:10:51.567 --> 00:10:53.361
Go scope their club room out, okay?

00:11:00.243 --> 00:11:03.496
Idol Study Club

00:11:04.121 --> 00:11:07.541
So, this would make you...

00:11:07.541 --> 00:11:10.211
President of Idol Study Club!?

00:11:14.257 --> 00:11:15.883
Love Live!

00:11:18.094 --> 00:11:20.930
Are you seriously the president?

00:11:25.393 --> 00:11:27.311
Open up, Prez!

00:11:27.311 --> 00:11:30.314
C'mon Prez, open the door!

00:11:30.314 --> 00:11:32.483
It's locked tight!

00:11:32.483 --> 00:11:33.734
Let's infiltrate from outside!

00:11:38.572 --> 00:11:40.449
Stop!

00:11:43.327 --> 00:11:45.913
Stop, stop, stop, stop, stop!

00:11:50.584 --> 00:11:52.420
Gotcha!

00:11:52.712 --> 00:11:54.547
Hey, wait!

00:11:55.756 --> 00:11:57.675
You'll never catch me.

00:12:05.016 --> 00:12:07.518
Huh? She isn't here?

00:12:07.518 --> 00:12:09.812
Where'd she go?

00:12:22.908 --> 00:12:25.202
That's an A-RISE poster!

00:12:25.202 --> 00:12:27.204
Aren't they the school idols from Fukuoka?

00:12:27.663 --> 00:12:30.249
I had no idea a room like this
existed inside our school.

00:12:30.249 --> 00:12:32.209
Mind not ogling my research material?

00:12:32.501 --> 00:12:34.670
Legendary Idol Legend
I-Is this...?

00:12:35.212 --> 00:12:39.550
Is this the "Legendary Idol Legend" complete
series premium edition DVD box set?

00:12:39.550 --> 00:12:41.844
It's the first time I've met
someone who owns this!

00:12:42.303 --> 00:12:43.512
R-Really?

00:12:43.512 --> 00:12:45.014
This is amazing!

00:12:45.014 --> 00:12:46.599
I-1 guess.

00:12:47.808 --> 00:12:49.518
Is it really that amazing?

00:12:49.518 --> 00:12:50.895
You don't know!?

00:12:50.895 --> 00:12:54.482
"Legendary Idol Legend" was released in
very limited quantities as a full DVD box set,

00:12:54.482 --> 00:12:57.193
made possible through a compromise
between its production companies,

00:12:57.193 --> 00:13:00.905
idol agencies, and the schools that featured
their fantastic idols from all over!

00:13:00.905 --> 00:13:03.574
Due to its value and rarity, it's known as
The Legendary Legend of Legends,

00:13:03.574 --> 00:13:05.368
or Le-Le-Legend, for short.

00:13:05.368 --> 00:13:08.454
Anyone who claims to love idols knows
all about this DVD box set!

00:13:08.454 --> 00:13:11.165
H-Hanayo-chan, something's
different about you today...

00:13:11.165 --> 00:13:15.795
To think that you own two of these sets—
sets that sell out online and in retail instantly...

00:13:15.795 --> 00:13:17.421
So. Impressed.

00:13:17.421 --> 00:13:19.590
I have my personal box set at home, too.

00:13:19.590 --> 00:13:20.925
Really!?

00:13:20.925 --> 00:13:22.468
Let's watch it together!

00:13:22.468 --> 00:13:24.428
No. It's a collector's item.

00:13:26.806 --> 00:13:28.391
Le-Le-Legend...

00:13:29.308 --> 00:13:32.144
I've never seen Kayo-chin fall into
a depression so profound!

00:13:34.021 --> 00:13:35.272
Oh, you finally noticed?

00:13:36.440 --> 00:13:39.902
Akiba Charisma Maid Minalinsky's autograph.

00:13:40.444 --> 00:13:42.405
Kotori, do you know her?

00:13:42.405 --> 00:13:43.906
N-Nope!

00:13:43.906 --> 00:13:48.828
Well, I got it online, so I can't say I've
actually seen her in person, either.

00:13:50.871 --> 00:13:53.707
A-Anyway, you're so amazing!

00:13:53.707 --> 00:13:56.085
So? Why'd you come here?

00:13:56.585 --> 00:13:58.295
Miss Idol Study Club President...

00:13:58.295 --> 00:13:59.130
Nico.

00:13:59.130 --> 00:14:03.717
Nico-senpai, believe it or not,
we're school idols...

00:14:03.717 --> 00:14:04.969
I kKnow.

00:14:04.969 --> 00:14:09.515
I bet that nosy Nozomi told you to come
talk to me about forming a club.

00:14:09.515 --> 00:14:11.058
Cool, that makes this simple.

00:14:11.058 --> 00:14:14.603
I figured such a thing would
happen eventually.

00:14:14.895 --> 00:14:15.354
Then...!

00:14:15.646 --> 00:14:16.730
I refuse.

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:17.189
What?

00:14:17.940 --> 00:14:19.400
Did I stutter? "I refuse."

00:14:19.775 --> 00:14:21.152
Um, well...

00:14:21.152 --> 00:14:25.698
All we're really seeking is a
space where ['s can practice.

00:14:25.698 --> 00:14:29.326
We're not asking you to give up your club...

00:14:29.326 --> 00:14:30.995
I already said that I refuse.

00:14:30.995 --> 00:14:34.582
I recall telling you that you're
all defiling the image of idols.

00:14:34.915 --> 00:14:38.002
But we practice so hard!
I think our abilities are—

00:14:38.002 --> 00:14:39.295
Not my point.

00:14:43.174 --> 00:14:46.927
Have you created characters for yourselves?

00:14:49.013 --> 00:14:49.889
Characters?

00:14:49.889 --> 00:14:51.098
Correct.

00:14:51.098 --> 00:14:55.853
Audiences come see idols because they
want to see a fun-filled fantasy, right?

00:14:55.853 --> 00:14:59.356
Idols must create appropriate characters
to make fans' wishes into reality.

00:14:59.356 --> 00:15:01.275
Hopeless amateurs.

00:15:01.567 --> 00:15:03.444
All right, pay attention.

00:15:05.488 --> 00:15:07.615
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:15:07.615 --> 00:15:10.493
I'll make your heartbeat throb "Nico-Nico-Ni"!

00:15:10.493 --> 00:15:13.287
I'm Yazawa Nico-Nico. I'm here
to make your heart smile!

00:15:13.287 --> 00:15:16.040
Don't forget Nico-Ni,
'cuz I Nico-Need you!

00:15:19.627 --> 00:15:20.461
Get it?

00:15:22.171 --> 00:15:23.547
That's...

00:15:23.547 --> 00:15:25.007
That's some character!

00:15:25.007 --> 00:15:26.258
I'll never do that.

00:15:26.258 --> 00:15:28.177
Isn't that pretty, uh, lame?

00:15:28.177 --> 00:15:29.470
Uh-huh, I see...

00:15:30.179 --> 00:15:32.932
Hey, you. Did you just call
my character lame?

00:15:32.932 --> 00:15:33.891
Uh, no!

00:15:33.891 --> 00:15:36.519
It was really cute! The best character ever!

00:15:36.519 --> 00:15:38.437
Maybe it could work...

00:15:38.437 --> 00:15:42.566
At the very least, it's true that we must
work hard to entertain the audience.

00:15:42.566 --> 00:15:44.985
Amazing! I expected nothing
less from you, Nico-senpai!

00:15:45.819 --> 00:15:47.821
Cool! Then mine'll be like—

00:15:47.821 --> 00:15:48.656
Leave.

00:15:48.656 --> 00:15:49.698
Huh?

00:15:49.698 --> 00:15:51.450
Discussion over!

00:15:51.450 --> 00:15:53.035
Get outta here!

00:15:56.622 --> 00:15:58.541
Nico-senpai!

00:15:58.541 --> 00:16:01.085
She tossed you out real quick, didn't she?

00:16:01.627 --> 00:16:03.254
A school idol?

00:16:03.254 --> 00:16:04.421
She was?

00:16:04.797 --> 00:16:07.258
It was back during our first year.

00:16:07.258 --> 00:16:10.177
She formed a group with some
other girls in our class.

00:16:10.177 --> 00:16:12.763
She isn't doing it anymore, obviously.

00:16:12.763 --> 00:16:14.098
Did she quit?

00:16:14.848 --> 00:16:16.850
Everyone did except for Nico-cchi.

00:16:18.686 --> 00:16:22.314
Her standards for being an idol
were probably too high for them.

00:16:22.314 --> 00:16:25.943
One by one, they all quit, saying they
couldn't handle her demands.

00:16:28.696 --> 00:16:31.991
Maybe that's why she's jealous of you.

00:16:32.616 --> 00:16:40.416
If she's able to criticize your abilities,
it means she's been watching you intently.

00:16:41.000 --> 00:16:44.003
Sounds like Nico-senpai has lots
to deal with on her own.

00:16:44.003 --> 00:16:45.045
True enough.

00:16:45.504 --> 00:16:47.756
She has sky-high standards.

00:16:47.756 --> 00:16:51.552
I doubt our performances will satisfy her.

00:16:52.011 --> 00:16:55.055
Plus, she seems set on
refusing to cooperate.

00:16:55.472 --> 00:16:57.182
You sure about that?

00:16:57.808 --> 00:17:00.352
Nico-senpai loves idols, right?

00:17:00.352 --> 00:17:02.563
I mean, she really admires them.

00:17:03.689 --> 00:17:06.734
And likewise, she's kinda been
interested in us, right?

00:17:06.734 --> 00:17:07.651
Yep.

00:17:07.651 --> 00:17:12.489
I get the feeling it'll all work out if we
just do a little something-something.

00:17:12.489 --> 00:17:14.742
How specific of you.

00:17:15.159 --> 00:17:17.036
Yeah, well...

00:17:22.583 --> 00:17:23.709
Was that...?

00:17:24.168 --> 00:17:25.377
Probably.

00:17:25.919 --> 00:17:27.046
What should we do?

00:17:28.255 --> 00:17:30.633
She'll probably run away again
if we try to talk with her.

00:17:37.556 --> 00:17:38.849
What's the matter?

00:17:38.849 --> 00:17:41.060
She's just like you, Umi-chan!

00:17:41.810 --> 00:17:44.521
When we first met you...

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:49.109
No!

00:17:49.443 --> 00:17:52.112
Now you're "it," Kotori-chan!

00:17:52.112 --> 00:17:53.405
Boo! No fair!

00:18:00.913 --> 00:18:02.873
Did that really happen?

00:18:02.873 --> 00:18:06.001
You were super shy.

00:18:07.044 --> 00:18:10.130
I fail to see how that relates
to our current situation!

00:18:11.215 --> 00:18:12.341
Right...

00:18:12.341 --> 00:18:13.592
Right?

00:18:14.176 --> 00:18:15.844
Oh, right...

00:18:15.844 --> 00:18:16.970
Yeah, right!

00:18:23.394 --> 00:18:26.230
Who do they think they are,
gabbing like close friends?

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:47.501
Wanna go somewhere?

00:18:47.501 --> 00:18:48.252
For sure.

00:18:48.252 --> 00:18:50.629
I know! Let's invite the girls in our club, too.

00:18:50.629 --> 00:18:52.214
Nice! Where should we all go?

00:18:52.214 --> 00:18:53.507
That one restaurant?

00:19:00.639 --> 00:19:03.058
Thanks for your hard work today!

00:19:06.895 --> 00:19:08.230
Your tea, Prez.

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:09.273
Prez?

00:19:09.273 --> 00:19:11.692
Here's this year's budget report, President.

00:19:12.985 --> 00:19:17.239
Prez! We moved the materials scattered
on this table to the shelves.

00:19:17.239 --> 00:19:18.449
Hey! You're not allowed—

00:19:18.449 --> 00:19:22.619
A-Anyway, care to recommend a
song to us for some inspiration?

00:19:22.619 --> 00:19:24.872
I-In that case, maybe we could
start by watching this.

00:19:25.497 --> 00:19:26.832
I told you, that's...!

00:19:26.832 --> 00:19:29.960
Just sayin', but we wanna talk to you
about our next song, Prez.

00:19:29.960 --> 00:19:34.381
We decided to become more aware of our
roles as idols for our next performance.

00:19:34.381 --> 00:19:37.342
And if you can help us think
up neat dance moves...

00:19:37.342 --> 00:19:39.970
We hope you'll assign our
vocal roles, as well.

00:19:41.513 --> 00:19:43.640
You think you'll break me with just this?

00:19:44.183 --> 00:19:48.353
Break you? We just wanna hear your advice.

00:19:49.229 --> 00:19:54.985
Use Otonokizaka's Idol Study Club to help the
seven members of p's with their next song.

00:19:55.944 --> 00:19:57.404
Seven members?

00:20:11.001 --> 00:20:12.169
Nico-senpai.

00:20:16.006 --> 00:20:17.257
It won't be easy.

00:20:17.674 --> 00:20:21.220
We know already! The road to
becoming idols is real tough, right!?

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:22.262
No, you don't!

00:20:22.262 --> 00:20:25.557
You're naive! And you, too!
Same goes for you!

00:20:25.891 --> 00:20:27.810
All of you!

00:20:27.810 --> 00:20:31.438
Listen up. Being an idol
isn't about you smiling.

00:20:31.897 --> 00:20:34.233
It's about making others smile!

00:20:34.233 --> 00:20:37.152
You'd better never forget that fact!

00:20:39.780 --> 00:20:43.700
Idol Study Club
Current Member List

00:20:45.953 --> 00:20:47.037
Eli-chi.

00:20:49.164 --> 00:20:50.624
Take a look.

00:20:51.959 --> 00:20:53.961
The rainy days are ending.

00:20:58.632 --> 00:20:59.216
Listen!

00:20:59.591 --> 00:21:04.179
Since you've decided to work for me, you'd
better put your souls into becoming idols!

00:21:04.179 --> 00:21:05.639
- Got that?
- Yes!

00:21:05.639 --> 00:21:06.807
Like you mean it!

00:21:07.182 --> 00:21:07.808
YES!

00:21:08.016 --> 00:21:08.600
Okay, so...

00:21:09.226 --> 00:21:11.103
It's great that our idea worked.

00:21:11.103 --> 00:21:11.603
Yeah.

00:21:11.603 --> 00:21:14.481
But is that really how it happened back then?

00:21:14.481 --> 00:21:17.818
Yep. I remember when Honoka-chan...

00:21:21.989 --> 00:21:23.156
Found ya!

00:21:26.743 --> 00:21:28.620
Now you're "it"!

00:21:29.079 --> 00:21:29.621
What?

00:21:30.914 --> 00:21:32.207
Let's play together!

00:21:35.878 --> 00:21:38.171
Nico-Nico-Ni! Okay, go.

00:21:38.171 --> 00:21:40.132
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:21:40.132 --> 00:21:41.925
Horrifying. Once more!

00:21:41.925 --> 00:21:43.260
Nico-cchi...

00:21:43.260 --> 00:21:45.721
Nico-Nico-Ni! Repeat.

00:21:45.721 --> 00:21:48.056
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:21:48.056 --> 00:21:49.933
Hey, Slanty Eyes! Up the energy, wouldja!?

00:21:49.933 --> 00:21:50.809
My name's Maki!

00:21:50.809 --> 00:21:52.853
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:21:54.104 --> 00:21:55.981
Better. One last time!

00:21:55.981 --> 00:21:58.358
Nico-Nico-Ni!

00:21:59.776 --> 00:22:02.070
That was worse. Thirty more times!

00:22:02.070 --> 00:22:03.655
Maaaaaaaan...

00:22:03.655 --> 00:22:06.450
No reason to complain about it.
We're just getting started, after all!

00:22:07.117 --> 00:22:09.494
Nico-senpai, please instruct us!

00:22:10.871 --> 00:22:14.875
You got it! Let's start this whole session over!

00:22:15.042 --> 00:22:20.672
Sunao ni oikakete yuukide oikakete Chase after
it with honesty, chase after it with courage.

00:22:20.964 --> 00:22:26.219
Chiisana negai ga ashita wo tsukuru That one
small wish is what will help to create tomorrow.

00:22:26.553 --> 00:22:32.643
Dekirukamo minna ga nozomunara It might
be possible if we all want it to come true.

00:22:32.643 --> 00:22:39.608
Dare yori ganbacchae tonikaku Jjounetsu no mama ni Give it
more effort than anyone else and stay as passionate as ever.

00:22:39.608 --> 00:22:44.655
Mezasu no wa kireina kaze fuku michi Let's aim to
find our path while riding on a beautiful wind.

00:22:45.572 --> 00:22:51.119
Hane no youni ude agete Spread your
arms out wide like they're your own wings.

00:22:51.119 --> 00:22:56.375
Mabushii mirai e to tobuyo We'll use
them to take off into our bright future.

00:22:57.584 --> 00:23:03.882
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ni kikoeru You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, you can hear it in this one moment.

00:23:04.216 --> 00:23:09.554
Egao nara itsu no hi mo daijoubu As long as
we see you smiling, every day is worth it!

00:23:09.554 --> 00:23:15.936
Kitto seishun ga kikoeru sono shunkan ga mitaine You can hear the
songs filled with our youth, we want to see you at that moment.

00:23:15.936 --> 00:23:21.775
Tonari ni kimi ga ite (ureshii keshiki) I want you
to be right beside me. (It's such happy scenery.)

00:23:21.775 --> 00:23:27.239
Tonari wa kimi nanda
Only when the one right there is you.

00:23:36.206 --> 00:23:39.376
Next time on Love Live!
"Who is the Center?"
